$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM tert-Butyl
3-[3-Chloro-4-[4-(trifluoromethoxy)phenoxy]phenyl]-sulfonyl-3-(tetrahydropyran-2-yloxycarbamoyl)-8-azaspiro[4.5]-decane-8-carboxylate
(38c). To a solution of compound 37c (8 mg, 0.11 mmol) in DMF (30 mL) was
added EDC·HCl (0.38 g, 0.2 mmol), HOBt (27 g, 0.2 mmol), THPONH2 (31 g,
0.2 mmol), and NMM (41 mg, 0.4 mmol), then the mixture was stirred at RT
overnight. The mixture was quenched with water and extracted with EtOAc,
and the organic layer was washed with brine, dried over anhydrous Na2SO4,
and concentrated to give the crude product which was purified by column.
The compound 38c (70 mg, 85%) as a pale-yellow solid. This intermediate
was used in the next step without further characterization. MS m/z 593
[M-139] calcd for C33H40ClF3N2O9S.
